{"id":"n87773-1-10","stage":5,"title":"휘다 · 折","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87773-1-10-1","ko":"승규가 축구공에 맞아 다쳤다면서?","zh":"听说承奎被足球砸伤了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"축구공에","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구공：足球；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"축구공","audio":"/audio/73e76a4fd71d7fec835b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27821","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구공에","audio":"/audio/d9fe2af229a55510c1ea.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아","meaning":"打中，被打中","explanation":"맞다：打中，被打中；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳤다면서?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳤다면서","audio":"/audio/b028cab89e870560c90f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"73e76a4fd71d7fec","term":"축구공","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/73e76a4fd71d7fec835b.mp3","entryId":"27821","definition":"足球运动使用的球。","pronunciation":["축꾸공"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"打中，被打中","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66233","definition":"射出或扔出的物体碰触到其它物体上；或被使得碰触到其它物体。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/609ac